OL,3,GNEWSAMan turned away from tip over DIY
OL,4,Awaste rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lincoln man says he was turned away
OL,7,Ffrom a recycling centre after trying to
OL,8,Fdispose of old guttering from his
OL,9,Fmother's home.
OL,11,FPeter Allen, 39, took the plastic
OL,12,Fguttering to Lincoln's household waste
OL,13,Frecycling centre after replacing it,
OL,14,Fbut was told it could not be accepted
OL,15,Funder the council's rules on DIY waste.
OL,17,FLincolnshire County Council said its
OL,18,Fpolicy had not changed and that
OL,19,Fresidents could bring only small
OL,20,Fquantities of DIY waste to recycling
OL,21,Fcentres.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
